      "css": ".ds-nav{box-sizing:border-box;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(max-content,1fr));padding:10px max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-right,0px)) calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)) max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-left,0px));border-top:1px solid #343939;background:#111413;font-family:'Manrope Variable', sans-serif}\n.ds-nav a{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;padding-inline:4px;min-height:58px;border-radius:13px;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;color:#9ca7a0;font-size:.6875rem;line-height:1.55}\n.ds-nav a[aria-current=page]{background:#222626;color:#b8f3d4}\n.ds-nav a:hover{color:#f5f5f0}\n.ds-nav svg{width:23px;height:23px;color:#f5f5f0;opacity:.7}\n.ds-nav a[aria-current=page] svg{opacity:1}\n.ds-nav span{white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.45}\n.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b8f3d4;outline-offset:4px}\n@media(min-width:768px){.ds-nav{width:100%;max-width:36rem;margin:0 auto 16px;gap:8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #343939;border-radius:22px}.ds-nav a{font-size:.8125rem}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Zvuk vypnutý",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Statický náhled přepínače SoundToggle: ikona, textový stav, aria-pressed a dotykový cíl 44 px. Náhled nepřehrává zvuk.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-sound-toggle\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Zvuk vypnutý, zapnout\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 10v4h4l5 4V6l-5 4H4Z\"/><path d=\"m16 9 5 6m0-6-5 6\"/></svg><span>Zvuk</span><span class=\"ds-sound-toggle__state\">Vypnuto</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-sound-toggle { display: inline-flex; min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .55rem; padding: .55rem .85rem; border: 1px solid #343939; border-radius: 999px; background: #191b1b; color: #f5f5f0; font: 650 1rem/1.55 'Manrope Variable', sans-serif; font-weight: 650; cursor: pointer; }\n.ds-sound-toggle--enabled { border-color: #b8f3d4; background: #17271e; }\n.ds-sound-toggle svg { width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-width: 1.8; }\n.ds-sound-toggle__state { padding: .12rem .45rem; border-radius: 999px; background: #222626; font-size: .75rem; }\n.ds-sound-toggle:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #b8f3d4; outline-offset: 2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Zvuk zapnutý",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Statický náhled přepínače SoundToggle: ikona, textový stav, aria-pressed a dotykový cíl 44 px. Náhled nepřehrává zvuk.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-sound-toggle ds-sound-toggle--enabled\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"Zvuk zapnutý, vypnout\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 10v4h4l5 4V6l-5 4H4Z\"/><path d=\"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6m2-9a9 9 0 0 1 0 12\"/></svg><span>Zvuk</span><span class=\"ds-sound-toggle__state\">Zapnuto</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-sound-toggle { display: inline-flex; min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .55rem; padding: .55rem .85rem; border: 1px solid #343939; border-radius: 999px; background: #191b1b; color: #f5f5f0; font: 650 1rem/1.55 'Manrope Variable', sans-serif; font-weight: 650; cursor: pointer; }\n.ds-sound-toggle--enabled { border-color: #b8f3d4; background: #17271e; }\n.ds-sound-toggle svg { width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-width: 1.8; }\n.ds-sound-toggle__state { padding: .12rem .45rem; border-radius: 999px; background: #222626; font-size: .75rem; }\n.ds-sound-toggle:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #b8f3d4; outline-offset: 2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Přehled postavy",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Jméno, svět, stav a jedna následující akce před portrétem. Čtecí oblast postavy má nejvýše 48 rem v zákaznickém kontejneru 64 rem s okraji clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px). Ukázková data bez živých požadavků.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-character-overview\" aria-labelledby=\"ds-character-title\"><div class=\"ds-character-overview__identity\"><h2 id=\"ds-character-title\">Ukázková postava</h2><p class=\"ds-character-world\">Ukázkový svět</p><p class=\"ds-character-overview__status\">Uloženo bez AI přípravy</p></div><p>Postava je uložená bez AI přípravy. Můžeš pokračovat do hry.</p><a class=\"ds-character-next\" href=\"#design-workshop\">Otevřít dílnu</a></section>",
      "css": ".ds-character-overview,.ds-character-overview *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.ds-character-overview{max-width:48rem;font:400 15px/1.65 'Manrope Variable', sans-serif;color:#f5f5f0}.ds-character-overview h2{font-weight:760}.ds-character-world{color:#b2b9b6}\n.ds-character-overview{display: grid; gap: 20px; padding-block-end: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #343939;}\n.ds-character-overview__identity{display: grid; gap: 8px;}\n.ds-character-overview h2{margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.2;}\n.ds-character-overview p{margin: 0; max-width: 65ch;}\n.ds-character-overview__status{color: #b8f3d4;}\n.ds-character-next{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;justify-self:start;min-height:54px;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:999px;background:#b8f3d4;color:#111513;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:750;line-height:1.45;text-decoration:none}.ds-character-next:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}.ds-character-next:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #b8f3d4;outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Poslední uložená památka",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "První položka v pořadí serveru vede příběhem a otevřením. Dostupnost zůstává viditelná, přístup a propojení jsou v rozbalovacích podrobnostech. Ukázková data; náhled nic neodpojuje ani nenačítá.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-keepsake\"><div class=\"ds-keepsake-heading\"><div><h2>Ukázkový příběh</h2><p class=\"ds-keepsake-latest\">Naposledy uložená památka</p></div><span class=\"ds-keepsake-status\">Připraveno</span></div><div class=\"ds-keepsake-actions\"><a class=\"ds-keepsake-open\" href=\"#design-keepsake\">Otevřít památku</a></div><details class=\"ds-keepsake-details\"><summary>Podrobnosti a správa</summary><ul aria-label=\"Dostupné části\"><li>Příběh je dostupný</li><li>Ilustrace je dostupná</li></ul><p>Tvoje památka · můžeš ji spravovat</p></details></article>",
      "css": ".ds-keepsake,.ds-keepsake *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.ds-keepsake{display:grid;gap:20px;min-width:0;padding:24px;border:0;border-radius:22px;background:#191b1b;color:#f5f5f0;font:400 15px/1.65 'Manrope Variable', sans-serif}.ds-keepsake-heading{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:.75rem 1rem}.ds-keepsake-heading>div{display:grid;gap:.35rem;min-width:0}.ds-keepsake h2{margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,2rem);font-weight:760;line-height:1.2}.ds-keepsake-latest{margin:0;color:#b2b9b6;font-size:.875rem}.ds-keepsake-status{padding:.2rem .65rem;border-radius:999px;background:#17271e;color:#f5f5f0}.ds-keepsake-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.75rem 1rem}.ds-keepsake-open{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:14px;background:#b8f3d4;color:#102419;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.ds-keepsake-open:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}.ds-keepsake-open:focus-visible,.ds-keepsake-details>summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #b8f3d4;outline-offset:4px}.ds-keepsake-details{display:grid;gap:.75rem}.ds-keepsake-details>summary{width:fit-content;min-height:44px;align-content:center;cursor:pointer;color:#b2b9b6}.ds-keepsake-details p{margin:0;color:#b2b9b6}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pod pečetí — uložený plán",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Místní potvrzení serverem uloženého plánu. Krátké dosednutí pečeti respektuje omezený pohyb; přijetí není úspěch akce.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sealed-receipt\"><span class=\"ds-sealed-receipt-stamp\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M225.86,102.82c-3.77-3.94-7.67-8-9.14-11.57-1.36-3.27-1.44-8.69-1.52-13.94-.15-9.76-.31-20.82-8-28.51s-18.75-7.85-28.51-8c-5.25-.08-10.67-.16-13.94-1.52-3.56-1.47-7.63-5.37-11.57-9.14C146.28,23.51,138.44,16,128,16s-18.27,7.51-25.18,14.14c-3.94,3.77-8,7.67-11.57,9.14C88,40.64,82.56,40.72,77.31,40.8c-9.76.15-20.82.31-28.51,8S41,67.55,40.8,77.31c-.08,5.25-.16,10.67-1.52,13.94-1.47,3.56-5.37,7.63-9.14,11.57C23.51,109.72,16,117.56,16,128s7.51,18.27,14.14,25.18c3.77,3.94,7.67,8,9.14,11.57,1.36,3.27,1.44,8.69,1.52,13.94.15,9.76.31,20.82,8,28.51s18.75,7.85,28.51,8c5.25.08,10.67.16,13.94,1.52,3.56,1.47,7.63,5.37,11.57,9.14C109.72,232.49,117.56,240,128,240s18.27-7.51,25.18-14.14c3.94-3.77,8-7.67,11.57-9.14,3.27-1.36,8.69-1.44,13.94-1.52,9.76-.15,20.82-.31,28.51-8s7.85-18.75,8-28.51c.08-5.25.16-10.67,1.52-13.94,1.47-3.56,5.37-7.63,9.14-11.57C232.49,146.28,240,138.44,240,128S232.49,109.73,225.86,102.82Zm-11.55,39.29c-4.79,5-9.75,10.17-12.38,16.52-2.52,6.1-2.63,13.07-2.73,19.82-.1,7-.21,14.33-3.32,17.43s-10.39,3.22-17.43,3.32c-6.75.1-13.72.21-19.82,2.73-6.35,2.63-11.52,7.59-16.52,12.38S132,224,128,224s-9.15-4.92-14.11-9.69-10.17-9.75-16.52-12.38c-6.1-2.52-13.07-2.63-19.82-2.73-7-.1-14.33-.21-17.43-3.32s-3.22-10.39-3.32-17.43c-.1-6.75-.21-13.72-2.73-19.82-2.63-6.35-7.59-11.52-12.38-16.52S32,132,32,128s4.92-9.15,9.69-14.11,9.75-10.17,12.38-16.52c2.52-6.1,2.63-13.07,2.73-19.82.1-7,.21-14.33,3.32-17.43S70.51,56.9,77.55,56.8c6.75-.1,13.72-.21,19.82-2.73,6.35-2.63,11.52-7.59,16.52-12.38S124,32,128,32s9.15,4.92,14.11,9.69,10.17,9.75,16.52,12.38c6.1,2.52,13.07,2.63,19.82,2.73,7,.1,14.33.21,17.43,3.32s3.22,10.39,3.32,17.43c.1,6.75.21,13.72,2.73,19.82,2.63,6.35,7.59,11.52,12.38,16.52S224,124,224,128,219.08,137.15,214.31,142.11ZM173.66,98.34a8,8,0,0,1,0,11.32l-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35A8,8,0,0,1,173.66,98.34Z\"/></svg></span><div><strong>Uložený plán: Pátrat</strong><p>Dům přijal tvůj plán. K jeho kvalitě se zatím nevyjadřuje.</p><small>Přijetí nepotvrzuje úspěch.</small></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sealed-receipt{color:#f5f5f0;font:15px/1.65 'Manrope Variable', sans-serif}.ds-sealed-receipt small{display:block;color:#b2b9b6;line-height:1.5}.ds-sealed-receipt { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding-block: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #343939; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n.ds-sealed-receipt strong { color: #b8f3d4; }\n.ds-sealed-receipt p { margin-block: 8px; }\n.ds-sealed-receipt-stamp { color:#102419; display: grid; place-items: center; flex: 0 0 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; background: #b8f3d4; transform: rotate(-8deg); }\n.ds-sealed-receipt-stamp svg { width: 32px; height: 32px; }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {\n  .ds-sealed-receipt-stamp { animation: sealed-stamp-settle 260ms cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1) both; }\n  @keyframes sealed-stamp-settle {\n    from { transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-18deg) scale(1.15); }\n    to { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-8deg) scale(1); }\n  }\n}\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "Průběh dílny kufru",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Statický výřez skutečného třífázového indikátoru ve stavu výroby. Aktuální krok má aria-current, mintovou linku a tučný popisek. Náhled nic nespouští; ilustrace, měřené audio a výsledky zůstávají v autorizované aplikaci.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-workshop-journey\" aria-label=\"Průběh tvorby hůlky\"><li data-complete=\"true\"><span>Rozhovor</span></li><li aria-current=\"step\"><span>Výroba</span></li><li><span>Tvoje hůlka</span></li></ol>",
